-- Telegraph |  This morning an infantry force appeared at Guiney’s ; his cavalry advanced at Downer’s Bridge, on Bowling Green road. He is apparently plac- ing the Mattapony between us, and will probably open communica- tion with Port Royal. I am extending on the Telegraph road, and will regulate my movements by the information [sh?] of his route. I fear [sic] will secure him from attack till he crosses Pamunkev. R. E. LEE. Special Orders, ) Adjt. and Insp. General’s O
